{"5095520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VIP Scandal Patrol", "steam_appid": 5095520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VIP Scandal Patrol is a chaotic 2–4 player co-op party security game where every client expects a different kind of night. Check the guests, handle disasters, work with your team and give each client exactly the party they asked for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEEP THE PARTY WILD, NOT OUT OF CONTROL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every client wants a different kind of night. Some want classy, some want crazy. Turn the party up when it is too tame, and pull it back before things go completely off the rails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/extras/77124d1aec291c881e850eb9b7ec26cb.poster.avif?t=1787523454\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/extras/77124d1aec291c881e850eb9b7ec26cb.webm?t=1787523454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/extras/77124d1aec291c881e850eb9b7ec26cb.mp4?t=1787523454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BRING FRIENDS. MAKE IT WORSE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split up, shout warnings, improvise on the fly and rescue each other's terrible decisions. Four players can solve problems much faster, assuming they are not busy creating new ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/extras/fe8f290726b43d3b85512c00f567da86.poster.avif?t=1787523454\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/extras/fe8f290726b43d3b85512c00f567da86.webm?t=1787523454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/extras/fe8f290726b43d3b85512c00f567da86.mp4?t=1787523454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHO LET THAT IN?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everyone gets through the door. Check invitations, inspect guests and search their belongings. Expect the strangest surprises to be hidden where you least expect them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/extras/96bb470c32138c0c120574f9ab4527b6.poster.avif?t=1787523454\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/extras/96bb470c32138c0c120574f9ab4527b6.webm?t=1787523454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/extras/96bb470c32138c0c120574f9ab4527b6.mp4?t=1787523454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MOPS, FIRE EXTINGUISHERS, BAD IDEAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drunk guests, jealous exes, fires, escaped animals and other disasters can turn a good night into mayhem in seconds. Grab whatever is nearby, deal with what matters and improvise when the sensible solution is nowhere to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/extras/9049f5343f874d2b38ee42aadf2c7ba1.poster.avif?t=1787523454\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/extras/9049f5343f874d2b38ee42aadf2c7ba1.webm?t=1787523454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/extras/9049f5343f874d2b38ee42aadf2c7ba1.mp4?t=1787523454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEW PARTY. NEW RULES.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A luxury villa, a yacht, a masquerade or a palace can all demand a completely different kind of night. New venues, clients and party setups change what can go wrong and how crazy the host actually wants things to get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/extras/c2edaaad442674114249cb4a68a9d779.poster.avif?t=1787523454\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/extras/c2edaaad442674114249cb4a68a9d779.webm?t=1787523454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/extras/c2edaaad442674114249cb4a68a9d779.mp4?t=1787523454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VIP Scandal Patrol is a chaotic 2–4 player co-op party security game where every client expects a different kind of night. Check the guests, handle disasters, work with your team and give each client exactly the party they asked for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEEP THE PARTY WILD, NOT OUT OF CONTROL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every client wants a different kind of night. Some want classy, some want crazy. Turn the party up when it is too tame, and pull it back before things go completely off the rails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/extras/77124d1aec291c881e850eb9b7ec26cb.poster.avif?t=1787523454\" width=1170 height=658 