95520/extras/c2edaaad442674114249cb4a68a9d779.mp4?t=1787523454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "VIP Scandal is a chaotic 2–4 player co-op party security sim. Check who gets in, handle ridiculous incidents, and keep each party at just the right level of wild. Keep the VIPs happy, improvise when things go wrong, and stop the night from becoming a scandal.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/3b16f55d9cb687ae99559e47f38d445f6dfd36d5/header.jpg?t=1787523454", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/b9bd6fb7f2c010288e1ffb8b11c2c8dd2173855c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787523454", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5095520/b9bd6fb7f2c010288e1ffb8b11c2c8dd2173855c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787523454", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / GTX 1650 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 / GTX 1070 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Direct